{"title":"블루 버드","artist":"이키모노가카리","sourceId":"reference:3i6sta7lIxSiajXWsrVI","sourceHash":"3f6e8b6308a26dfe2593df2b7a88c8a12c19080fe8d05368990a2c7aa9b8332e","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":11338960,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.24,"end":6.6,"text":"飛翔いたら 戻らないと言って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":6.6,"end":14.17,"text":"目指したのは 蒼い 蒼い あの空","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":25.66,"end":28.97,"text":"\"悲しみ\"はまだ覚えられず","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":28.97,"end":32.22,"text":"\"切なさ\"は今つかみはじめた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":32.22,"end":35.28,"text":"あなたへと抱く この感情も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":35.28,"end":38.16,"text":"今\"言葉\"に変わっていく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":38.16,"end":44.61,"text":"未知なる世界の 遊迷から目覚めて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":44.61,"end":51.03,"text":"この羽根を広げ 飛び立つ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":51.03,"end":57.01,"text":"飛翔いたら 戻らないと言って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":57.01,"end":63.57,"text":"探したのは 白い 白い あの雲","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":63.57,"end":69.8,"text":"突き抜けたら みつかると知って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":69.8,"end":74.24,"text":"振り切るほど 蒼い 蒼い あの空","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":76.4,"end":79.2,"text":"蒼い 蒼い あの空","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":79.2,"end":84.26,"text":"蒼い 蒼い あの空","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":88.92,"end":92.14,"text":"愛想尽きたような音で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":92.14,"end":95.49000000000001,"text":"錆びれた古い窓は壊れた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":95.49000000000001,"end":98.75999999999999,"text":"見飽きたカゴは ほら捨てていく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":98.75999999999999,"end":101.44,"text":"振り返ることはもうない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":101.44,"end":107.61,"text":"高鳴る鼓動に 呼吸を共鳴けて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":107.61,"end":113.6,"text":"この窓を蹴って 飛び立つ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":113.6,"end":120.53,"text":"駆け出したら 手にできると言って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":120.53,"end":126.39,"text":"いざなうのは 遠い 遠い あの声","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":126.39,"end":133.06,"text":"眩しすぎた あなたの手も握って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":133.06,"end":141.02,"text":"求めるほど 蒼い 蒼い あの空","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":152.43,"end":158.61,"text":"墜ちていくと わかっていた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":158.61,"end":166.12,"text":"それでも 光を追い続けていくよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":166.12,"end":172.5,"text":"飛翔いたら 戻れないと言って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":172.5,"end":179.07,"text":"探したのは 白い 白い あの雲","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":179.07,"end":185.16,"text":"突き抜けたら みつかると知って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":185.16,"end":191.35,"text":"振り切るほど 蒼い 蒼い あの空","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":191.35,"end":194.42,"text":"蒼い 蒼い あの空","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":194.42,"end":197.53,"text":"蒼い 蒼い あの空","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}